ational-tourism/singapore-tourism/places-to-visit-in-singapore/gardens-by-the-bay/14422', 'snippet': "Explore Gardens by the Bay, Singapore's iconic attraction. Discover its timings, entry fee, stunning attractions, and why it's a must-visit destination in Singapore"}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 2.9041127000236884}
