{'query': 'Singapore Night Safari prices', 'results': [{'title': 'Night Safari Admission Tickets - Singapore', 'url': 'https://www.mandai.com/en/tickets-and-passes/single-attractions/night-safari.html', 'snippet': 'All children below the age of 3 ... years old holding an Admission Ticket to the same Attractions. All prices are in Singapore dollars and inclusive of 9% GST....'}, {'title': 'Night Safari Singapore Ticket Price - Book Now', 'url': 'https://www.makemytrip.com/activities/safari-in-singapore/night-safari-singapore.html', 'snippet': 'You can plan your visit around the various feeding sessions and guided tram rides to gain the fullest insight into the animals’ natural behaviours. The Singapore Night Safari ticket price provides access to all standard exhibits, ensuring that your evening experience is seamless and comprehensive.'}, {'title': 'Singapore Night Safari Tickets with Tram Ride: Get Best Deals!', 'url': 'https://www.mysingaporepass.com/products/night-safari', 'snippet': 'Singapore Night Safari tickets cost approximately from (SGD 49 to SGD 55) for adult visitors. The prices differ for senior citizens aged sixty and above and visitors aged three to twelve.'}, {'title': 'Singapore Zoo & Singapore Night Safari Tickets Combo', 'url': 'https://www.thrillophilia.com/tours/singapore-zoo-and-night-safari', 'snippet': "What's more, the zoo doesn't charge kids under 3years · The ticket prices rely on the age of the visitor. Typically, children between 3 to 12 years pay $27.20. On the other hand, adults pay between $40.80 to $57.00. Night Safari does not charge ..."}, {'title': 'Singapore Night Safari Tickets, Prices & Visitor Guide 2026 | Trip.com', 'url': 'https://sg.trip.com/guide/attraction/night-safari-tickets.html', 'snippet': 'June 18, 2026 - Operating Hours: 19:15-23:59 (Latest entry time: 23:15) Address: 80 Mandai Lake Rd, Singapore 729826 Buy Discounted Tickets from S$49.00 · Perfect for family and children, exploring animals in the rainforest at night.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 3.4585180999711156}
{'query': 'Sentosa Island admission prices', 'results': [{'title': 'Sentosa Fun Discovery Pass 2026 – 80+ Attractions from S$60', 'url': 'https://www.sentosa.com.sg/en/deals/fun-discovery-pass/', 'snippet': 'Each pass includes 2 complimentary island admissions, valid for entry via the Sentosa Express monorail or Sentosa Gateway gantry. These are included in your pass — no tokens are required for island entry.'}, {'title': 'Sentosa Reservation', 'url': 'https://www.sentosa.com.sg/en/sentosareservation/', 'snippet': 'Before you head to the island, plan your trip and make a prior reservation with the attractions or F&B that you are visiting! Please ensure that you have purchased a valid ticket/voucher before making a reservation.'}, {'title': 'Sentosa Entry Fees and Attractions: 2026 Cost Guide', 'url': 'https://themoneybees.co/blog/sentosa-entry-fees-attractions', 'snippet': 'There is no per-person gate fee to get onto Sentosa. You can walk across the Sentosa Boardwalk from VivoCity for free, any day, any time.'}, {'title': 'Sentosa Island Ticket Prices: Your Guide to Fun in Singapore', 'url': 'https://www.agoda.com/travel-guides/singapore/sentosa-island-ticket-prices-your-guide-to-fun-in-singapore/', 'snippet': 'Feb 10, 2025 · Ticket prices can vary based on the day of the week and whether you purchase them in advance or at the gate. Typically, expect to pay around S$81 for a standard adult ticket. Keep an eye out for special promotions that might pop up during peak seasons or holidays!'}, {'title': 'Sentosa Island Tickets 2026 — Real Prices, Resident Rates ...', 'url': 'https://singaporecity360.com/attractions/sentosa-island/', 'snippet': 'Sentosa Island tickets from S$4 for Singapore residents, S$4 for visitors. Full published price table, opening hours, best MRT exit and a group cost calculator.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 4.680342299980111}
